Rāvaṇa sends Jambumālī with thundering bow --- Jambumālī wounds Hanumān face head arms with arrows --- Hanumān hurls rock and Jambumālī shatters it --- Hanumān whirls sāla tree and Jambumālī splinters it --- Hanumān smashes Jambumālī chest with whirled beam --- Jambumālī falls crushed and Rāvaṇa sends minister sons